  Content: "Once home to one of Dawson\u2019s longest-running newspapers, the Dawson
    Daily News building preserves northern Canada\u2019s journalistic legacy. A historic
    hub for printers and publishers from 1899 to 1954, it now invites visitors to
    reflect on the stories, people, and presses that helped shape Dawson\u2019s media-rich
    Gold Rush past."
  RavenSucessScript: Dawson Daily News! Juicy headlines, sweet scraps. CAW-rect!
  RavenHintScript: "\u201CCollect every stamp to unlock the secret finale. Trust
    me\u2014it\u2019s worth the squawk.\u201D"
